  "updated_at": "2026-03-29",
  "bio": "Phil Coupet is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the black and gray style, with a reputation for impeccable cleanliness in his workspaces. Operating between East Coast's Endless Summer Tattoo in Cocoa Beach, Florida, and West Coast's Earthbound Tattoo Studio in Seaside, California, Phil ensures a safe and sterile environment, guaranteeing clients not only stunning artwork but also peace of mind during the tattooing process. Reach out to Phil via direct message to schedule your next tattoo in a meticulously maintained setting.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Seaside, California, United States"
